# Profiling — new CPython minor

When editing profiling natives, collectors, or `setup.py` version gates:

1. **Pointers** — start from
   `.claude/skills/migrate-profiling-new-cpython/SKILL.md` and
   `docs/contributing-profiling-new-cpython.rst`. Do not invent a parallel
   checklist. ABI/hook answers live in `docs/cpython-diffs/py3XX_pr_catalog.md`
   and live PR states in `scripts/py3XX-stack/PROFILING_STACK.md`.

2. **Registry / verify / suitespec** — `scripts/profiles/profiling_versions.json`,
   local verify, `run-profiling-tests`, and suitespec matrix opt-in live on
   #19273 (Q4 tooling), not this docs closeout.

3. **Hard stops** — never enable SSI/OCI before final; never claim memory parity
   without an A/B; never skip staging auth preflight; never mix prerelease ABIs.
